{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24852","headline":"送郑丞之罗浮中习业 · 杨衡","name":"送郑丞之罗浮中习业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百年泛飘忽，万事系衰荣。\n高鸿脱矰缴，达士去簪缨。\n始从天目游，复作罗浮行。\n云卧石林密，月窥花洞明。\n全形在气和，习默凭境清。\n夙秘绦囊诀，屡投金简名。\n钟管促离觞，烟霞随去程。\n何当真府内，重得欵平生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}